Function
Role




request(url)
Creates a base request with the target URL


req_method("POST")
Sets the HTTP verb


req_body_json(data, auto_unbox = FALSE)
Serialises data as JSON arrays; sets Content-Type: application/json


req_perform()
Sends the assembled request; returns a response object


resp_body_json()
Parses the JSON response body into an R list





